            "value": "本机模式可以在播放头位置分割片段，或将此处设为视频的开头或结尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local can't do %@. It can change the length, the pace, the look, the music, the frame shape (vertical, square), and which files to use or take out, by name. For anything that needs understanding what's in your shots, use Claude or ChatGPT.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本地模式无法执行“%@”。它可以调整成片时长、节奏、色调、音乐、画幅比例（竖屏、方形），以及按文件名保留或剔除素材。如果需要理解画面内容进行剪辑，请使用 Claude 或 ChatGPT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Local couldn't read that": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
