    },
    "Magic couldn't find anything to make a cut from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑找不到可用于剪辑的素材。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Magic makes an edit for you: a quick cut on this Mac, or one Claude or ChatGPT works out from what you ask. Off hides the Magic button.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑可在本机快速剪辑，也可让 Claude 或 ChatGPT 根据你的要求剪辑。关闭后会隐藏魔法剪辑按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Magic uses ChatGPT through Codex, which comes with the ChatGPT app, with your ChatGPT plan. It needs signing in once, in your browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑会通过 ChatGPT 应用自带的 Codex 调用你的 ChatGPT 订阅，首次使用需在浏览器中登录一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Magic uses Claude Code, which comes with the Claude app. Open the Claude app's Code tab once, then come back.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑使用 Claude 应用自带的 Claude Code。请先打开一次 Claude 应用的 Code 标签页，然后返回此处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Magic uses Claude through Claude Code on this Mac, with your Claude plan. It needs signing in once, in your browser.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑会通过此 Mac 上的 Claude Code 调用你的 Claude 订阅，首次使用需在浏览器中登录一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Magic: have Claude or ChatGPT edit, or make a quick cut": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "魔法剪辑：让 Claude 或 ChatGPT 帮你剪辑，或快速一键成片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a 30 to 60 second highlight reel of the best moments, cut to the beat of the music, opening on the strongest shot and ending on a bar.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "制作一段 30 到 60 秒的高光混剪，精选最佳镜头并踩音乐节拍剪辑，以最震撼的画面开场并在小节处收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a fast, punchy 15 to 30 second vertical video for Reels and TikTok: 1080 by 1920, a hook in the first second, quick cuts on the beat.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "制作一段节奏明快的 15 到 30 秒竖屏短视频（适合 Reels / 抖音，1080×1920）：第 1 秒即抛吸睛开场，随节拍快速切换镜头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make a timelapse over the music: speed the footage up, cut out the dead space where nothing changes, keep the moments where something happens, and end on the strongest shot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配合音乐制作一段延时摄影剪辑：加快素材速度，剪掉毫无变化的空档，保留有动态变化的精彩时刻，并以最惊艳的画面收尾。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make an engaging vlog, up to 8 minutes: hook in the first few seconds, keep the parts where someone is talking or something happens, cut pauses, retakes and repeats, and add short titles to mark each part.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪辑一段生动紧凑的 Vlog（最长 8 分钟）：前几秒给出亮点开场，保留说话与精彩动作片段，剪除停顿、重拍与重复部分，并添加简短标题划分章节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始制作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make the best story you can from this footage: a clear beginning, middle and end, the strongest moments where they land hardest, and shots left to breathe where it matters.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用这些素材讲述一个精彩故事：结构清晰（起、承、转、合），在最关键处安放最强镜头，并在需要抒情的地方留出呼吸空间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make this shorter so people keep watching: open on the strongest moment, cut the slow starts and ends of shots, and drop weak or repeated shots.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精简片段以提升完播率：用最抓人的瞬间开场，剪掉镜头开头和结尾的拖沓部分，删去平庸或重复的镜头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
